  cden (Ap_Alph_011_111_1 q0 ++ [S0]) [] j P1_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_1LD0RA_1RC0LA = Cc (Pos.succ p).
Proof.
  intros p j q0 E. destruct (Alph_011_111_1.cview_some_Alph_011_111_1 p (S j) q0 E) as (H1 & H2).
  unfold Cc_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_1LD0RA_1RC0LA, cden, P0_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_1LD0RA_1RC0LA, P1_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_1LD0RA_1RC0LA; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
