    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_0RB1LC_1LA1RB_1RC1LD_0RD0LA [SWinR 2; SCycL 3 0; SWin 6] (StD, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
                   p1 j1 E1).
Qed.

